@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState : User is in the main interface

InitialState --> [*] : User exits the application

InitialState --> WaitingForInput : User clicks "Quick Search" button

WaitingForInput : Waiting for user to enter keyword or phrase

WaitingForInput --> PerformingSearch : User enters keyword/phrase and clicks "Quick Search"

PerformingSearch : Searching for documents matching the keyword/phrase

PerformingSearch --> DisplayingResults : Search results found

DisplayingResults : Displaying search results to user

DisplayingResults --> InitialState : User selects a document to view

DisplayingResults --> [*] : User chooses to exit

PerformingSearch --> NoResultsFound : No matching documents found

NoResultsFound : Displaying "No results found" message

NoResultsFound --> InitialState : User clicks to perform new search

NoResultsFound --> [*] : User chooses to exit

@enduml
